OL,3,GNEWSASDLP assembly member sorry for
OL,4,A#550 coffee machine expenses claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn SDLP assembly member has apologised
OL,7,Ffor claiming taxpayer-funded expenses
OL,8,Fto install a #550 coffee machine in his
OL,9,Fconstituency office.
OL,11,FOn Tuesday evening McCrossan said after
OL,12,Freflection, and at a time when people
OL,13,Fare facing rising costs of living, he
OL,14,Fcould understand "annoyance and
OL,15,Ffrustration about the price".
OL,17,FThe machine, he added, would be donated
OL,18,Fto a local community group, and its
OL,19,Fcost repaid in full to the Northern
OL,20,FIreland Assembly.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
